#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Classical gates {#classical-gates}"
msgstr "Portes classiques {#classical-gates}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "**NOT Gate**\n"
msgstr "**Porte NOT**\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The NOT gate, also known as the Pauli X gate, flips the $\\left|0\\right\\rangle$ state to $\\left|1\\right\\rangle$, and vice versa. The NOT gate is equivalent to RX for the angle $\\pi$ or to ‘HZH’.\n"
msgstr "La porte NOT, également connue sous le nom de porte Pauli X, bascule l'état $\\left|0\\right\\rangle$ vers $\\left|1\\right\\rangle$, et vice versa. La porte NOT équivaut à RX pour l'angle $\\pi$ ou à 'HZH'.\n"

