#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Y gate**\n"
msgstr "**Porte Y**\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The Pauli Y gate is equivalent to Ry for the angle $\\pi$. It is equivalent to applying X and Z, up to a global phase factor.\n"
